### ============================================================
###  PE2 — FoodService (/api/foods) — Feign sang Restaurant
###  Status map: 1=OK  2=validation  4=not found  0=500
###  Create/Update/Get trả FoodDTO PHẲNG (restaurantId);
###  CHỈ List trả FoodListDTO {pageSize,pageNo,totalPages,first,last,foods[]}
###  với restaurant NESTED — khác PE1, và KHÔNG có totalElements!
### ============================================================

### 01. Create food — hợp lệ
# Expect: 201, status=1, data PHẲNG có restaurantId (không nested)
POST {{detailUrl}}/api/foods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Spring Rolls",
  "price": 45,
  "ingredients": "rice paper, pork, shrimp",
  "restaurantId": 1
}

### 02. Create — restaurantId không tồn tại (Feign verify)
# Expect: 400, status=4, "Restaurant ID is not found"
# (đề Trial ghi nhầm "Department ID is not found" — PE2 đã quyết sửa theo ngữ cảnh, xem DECISIONS.md #6)
POST {{detailUrl}}/api/foods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost Food",
  "price": 10,
  "ingredients": "air",
  "restaurantId": 99999
}

### 02b. Create — thiếu restaurantId hoàn toàn
# Expect: 400, status=2, "restaurantId is required"
POST {{detailUrl}}/api/foods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "No Restaurant Food",
  "price": 10,
  "ingredients": "air"
}

### 03. Create — thiếu name
# Expect: 400, status=2
POST {{detailUrl}}/api/foods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 10,
  "ingredients": "something",
  "restaurantId": 1
}

### 04. Create — thiếu price (NotNull)
# Expect: 400, status=2
POST {{detailUrl}}/api/foods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "No Price Food",
  "ingredients": "mystery",
  "restaurantId": 1
}

### 05. Create — thiếu ingredients
# Expect: 400, status=2
POST {{detailUrl}}/api/foods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "No Ingredients",
  "price": 20,
  "restaurantId": 1
}

### 06. Get detail — id có sẵn trong init_trial_db.sql
# Expect: 200, status=1, data PHẲNG (restaurantId, không có object restaurant)
GET {{detailUrl}}/api/foods/1

### 07. Get detail — không tồn tại
# Expect: 400, status=4
GET {{detailUrl}}/api/foods/99999

### 08. Update — partial: chỉ đổi price
# Expect: 200, status=1
PUT {{detailUrl}}/api/foods/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 400
}

### 09. Update — đổi restaurantId hợp lệ (Feign verify lại)
# Expect: 200, status=1, data.restaurantId=2
PUT {{detailUrl}}/api/foods/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 2
}

### 10. Update — restaurantId không tồn tại
# Expect: 400, status=4
PUT {{detailUrl}}/api/foods/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 99999
}

### 11. Update — status ngoài enum ACTIVE|INACTIVE
# Expect: 400, status=2
PUT {{detailUrl}}/api/foods/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "SOLD_OUT"
}

### 12. Update — id không tồn tại
# Expect: 400, status=4
PUT {{detailUrl}}/api/foods/99999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost"
}

### 13. Deactivate (soft delete)
# Expect: 200, status=1; get lại id=3 → status="INACTIVE"
DELETE {{detailUrl}}/api/foods/3

### 14. Deactivate — không tồn tại
# Expect: 400, status=4
DELETE {{detailUrl}}/api/foods/99999

### 15. List — mặc định — ĐIỂM KHÁC BIỆT LỚN NHẤT của PE2
# Expect: 200, status=1, data = FoodListDTO {pageSize,pageNo,totalPages,first,last,foods}
#   KHÔNG có totalElements; mỗi phần tử foods[] có restaurant NESTED (Feign per row)
GET {{detailUrl}}/api/foods

### 16. List — phân trang
# Expect: 200, pageSize=2, pageNo=0
GET {{detailUrl}}/api/foods?page=0&size=2

### 17. List — filter name partial
# Expect: 200, foods chỉ chứa món có "Grilled"
GET {{detailUrl}}/api/foods?name=Grilled

### 18. List — filter ingredients partial (tên param của đề Trial!)
# Expect: 200, foods chỉ chứa món có "beef" trong ingredients
GET {{detailUrl}}/api/foods?ingredients=beef

### 19. List — size vượt 100
# Expect: 400, status=2
GET {{detailUrl}}/api/foods?size=101

### 20. List — page âm
# Expect: 400, status=2
GET {{detailUrl}}/api/foods?page=-1
